{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03975","headline":"夜宴安乐公主新宅 · 刘宪","name":"夜宴安乐公主新宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"层轩洞户旦新披，度曲飞觞夜不疲。\n绮缀玲珑河色晓，珠帘隐映月华窥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘宪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03975.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03975","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}